{%- comment -%}
  finder_key -> this package's koop (Kopen) monthly service-fee cents, from pricing.config.json
  (koopMaandelijks). Added 2026-11-02 alongside zv_koop_maandelijks_by_fk in zv-pricing.liquid:
  the figure was already shown on Oplossingen's Kopen note but silently dropped from "Daarna"
  once a Koop line reached /cart or Overzicht. No per-line note is added for it here, matching
  today's fix/remove-cart-overzicht-notes-2026-11-02 (every line type lost its per-line note the
  same day) - this snippet only feeds the "Daarna" total. See
  docs/koop-maandelijks-cart-2026-11-02.md.

  Params: finder_key (a Koop line's package finder_key, from zv-koop-fk), maandelijks
  (zv_koop_maandelijks_by_fk from zv-pricing, 'fk:cents|fk:cents|...' - passed in because
  `render` doesn't inherit the caller's scope). Outputs the raw cents integer with no
  surrounding whitespace, or nothing if finder_key is blank or has no koop figure (Vista,
  Veilig Onderweg): the caller should treat a blank/absent result as 0, never as a real
  "free" service fee.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- if finder_key != blank -%}
  {%- assign zv_km_pairs = maandelijks | split: '|' -%}
  {%- for zv_km_pair in zv_km_pairs -%}
    {%- assign zv_km_kv = zv_km_pair | split: ':' -%}
    {%- if zv_km_kv[0] == finder_key -%}{{ zv_km_kv[1] }}{%- break -%}{%- endif -%}
  {%- endfor -%}
{%- endif -%}
